# KALI3977 — COMPLETE PLATFORM MASTER IMPLEMENTATION

## 1. PROJECT IDENTITY AND VISION

Project name: KALI3977

Kali3977 is a comprehensive, completely free cybersecurity learning, practical training, competition and community platform.

It must serve:
- Absolute beginners with no programming or cybersecurity experience.
- School and university students.
- First-year through final-year cybersecurity students.
- Intermediate and advanced learners.
- Professional penetration testers and security researchers.
- Experienced practitioners seeking specialist and research-level knowledge.

The platform must continuously expand. Do not restrict the curriculum to a short beginner course or a fixed collection of topics.

IMPORTANT:
- Continue working on the existing Kali3977 project.
- Do not create a new application.
- Do not unnecessarily replace the existing architecture.
- Preserve existing features, accounts, records, progress and data.
- Do not rebuild unrelated working components.

## 2. PERMANENT FREE PLATFORM POLICY

Kali3977 must remain 100% free for every user. This is a permanent platform policy.

Completely prohibit:
- Paid memberships.
- Premium accounts.
- Paid courses.
- Paid Cyber Labs.
- Paid tools or learning materials.
- Subscription plans.
- Payment gateways.
