All educational content, courses, tools, labs, games, competitions and learning resources must be accessible without payment.

Reasonable technical fair-use limits, security restrictions and infrastructure quotas are permitted, but they must never become payment requirements.

Audit the entire application for existing payment restrictions and remove them safely.

Preserve all user data, achievements, progress and historical records.

